WEBVTT

01:15.950 --> 01:20.330
<i><b>On the Dark Side</b></i>

01:38.550 --> 01:39.470
<b>Kikyo!</b>

01:40.140 --> 01:41.600
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

01:42.220 --> 01:44.850
<b>I'm too, am a student of Yagyu Tanba.</b>

01:44.850 --> 01:48.350
<b>I will have vengeance for my master.</b>

02:18.180 --> 02:19.180
<b>Eric...</b>

02:19.180 --> 02:22.260
<b>leave this to me, and go onward.</b>

02:22.260 --> 02:23.260
<b>Kikyo...</b>

02:36.740 --> 02:38.570
<b>A giant, seven-headed snake...</b>

02:40.160 --> 02:42.740
<b>I, Mikage Kikyo, will face you.</b>

02:57.630 --> 02:58.720
<b>Well, then...</b>

03:00.380 --> 03:03.470
<b>Let's go ahead
and start the fireworks.</b>

03:17.820 --> 03:20.700
<b>Welcome to my throne room.</b>

03:24.120 --> 03:26.830
<b>I'm impressed you made it this far.</b>

03:26.830 --> 03:28.700
<b>First, my congratulations.</b>

03:29.750 --> 03:31.120
<b>Deacon Frost...!</b>

03:32.960 --> 03:35.040
<b>Your plan is over!</b>

03:35.960 --> 03:38.300
<b>Now, don't be hasty...</b>

03:39.010 --> 03:43.550
<b>There's some people
I'd like to introduce you to.</b>

03:43.890 --> 03:44.680
<b>What?</b>

03:46.810 --> 03:49.560
<b>Come forth, my children.</b>

04:15.710 --> 04:17.290
<b>Eric...</b>

04:17.290 --> 04:18.670
<b>this is your last chance.</b>

04:19.260 --> 04:23.930
<b>Why don't you reshape
the world with me?</b>

04:24.430 --> 04:27.430
<b>You're one of my sons, as well.</b>

04:27.970 --> 04:32.140
<b>Existence would be happy to have you.</b>

04:46.160 --> 04:47.740
<b>I understand.</b>

04:47.740 --> 04:51.750
<b>Why don't you roughhouse with your brothers
until they've killed you, then?</b>

04:52.910 --> 04:53.910
<b>Wait!</b>

05:32.450 --> 05:33.870
<b>This is it...</b>

05:33.870 --> 05:37.580
<b>The heart of Armoroad.</b>

05:39.040 --> 05:39.750
<b>Alright...</b>

05:55.100 --> 05:56.230
<b>Oh no!</b>

07:07.590 --> 07:09.280
<b>Let's go, miss.</b>

07:09.760 --> 07:13.100
<b>Let's give them a heart attack!</b>

10:10.110 --> 10:12.610
<b>These things are my brothers?</b>

10:13.440 --> 10:15.070
<b>That's a sick joke...</b>

10:31.630 --> 10:33.210
<b>As you perish...</b>

10:34.000 --> 10:38.220
<b>let me offer you this final strike.</b>

10:57.240 --> 10:59.280
<b>Deacon Frost!</b>

12:16.150 --> 12:20.150
<b>I've sent countless assassins after you...</b>

12:21.110 --> 12:22.650
<b>do you know why?</b>

12:24.200 --> 12:29.830
<b>It was to get the Daywalker
blood within you pumping.</b>

12:31.540 --> 12:38.340
<b>I would then let your concentrated blood mingle
with mine, that of the ultimate hybrid...</b>

12:39.300 --> 12:42.300
<b>and that let my sons become Daywalkers...</b>

12:43.550 --> 12:47.050
<b>as I had planned all along.</b>

12:48.640 --> 12:53.520
<b>Still, I had no idea
it would be this easy.</b>

12:54.980 --> 12:56.480
<b>That reminds me...</b>

12:56.480 --> 12:58.230
<b>whatever happened to that girl?</b>

12:59.230 --> 13:01.820
<b>I'd like to give her my thanks.</b>

13:05.530 --> 13:06.660
<b>Don't tell me...!</b>

13:07.320 --> 13:10.160
<b>You didn't kill her, did you?</b>

13:14.540 --> 13:16.540
<b>Oh, Eric...</b>

13:17.290 --> 13:19.340
<b>You killed your mother...</b>

13:20.170 --> 13:23.510
<b>and now you've killed one
of your human friends.</b>

13:24.720 --> 13:26.220
<b>Vampire hunter?</b>

13:26.800 --> 13:28.550
<b>What a joke.</b>

13:42.650 --> 13:46.660
<b>Looks like silver still works.</b>

13:48.370 --> 13:50.580
<b>It's a trifling matter.</b>

14:02.380 --> 14:05.260
<b>Worthless apes...</b>

14:05.260 --> 14:10.760
<b>In that case,
I'll make full use of your power.</b>

14:59.900 --> 15:01.520
<b>It's so warm...</b>

15:03.860 --> 15:05.480
<b>This warmth...</b>

15:06.400 --> 15:08.570
<b>how nostalgic.</b>

15:12.120 --> 15:14.010
<b>You too, huh?</b>

15:16.830 --> 15:17.770
<b>Look!</b>

15:18.910 --> 15:22.830
<b>I've even been able to conquer the sun!</b>

15:22.830 --> 15:26.050
<b>The world belongs to me now!</b>

15:26.710 --> 15:31.050
<b>I'm gonna kill you
and your fucked up scheme!</b>

15:32.090 --> 15:36.560
<b>The rage, and pain of all the people
who died because of you...</b>

15:37.180 --> 15:38.930
<b>have a taste of it!</b>

16:54.630 --> 16:55.590
<b>I'm not done!</b>

17:25.710 --> 17:30.250
<b>It doesn't matter how much you struggle,
you'll never be able to stop me.</b>

17:37.340 --> 17:38.260
<b>Idiot!</b>

17:38.720 --> 17:41.560
<b>Follow the girl's steps, and die!</b>

17:44.680 --> 17:45.990
<b>Makoto!</b>

17:45.990 --> 17:50.190
<b>Let's do it!</b>

18:02.490 --> 18:04.290
<b>You bastard!</b>

18:15.590 --> 18:18.260
<b>My partner sent this for you!</b>

18:18.260 --> 18:20.930
<b>Take it!</b>

19:26.540 --> 19:28.160
<b>You find him yet?</b>

19:33.590 --> 19:34.920
<b>We need to get moving!</b>

19:34.920 --> 19:35.650
<b>Got it!</b>

19:36.590 --> 19:37.360
<b>Seeya.</b>

19:38.010 --> 19:39.470
<b>When things settle down,
let's go get a drink.</b>

20:11.750 --> 20:13.250
<b>Eric...</b>

20:18.760 --> 20:20.590
<b>You survived!</b>

20:24.590 --> 20:25.430
<b>Eric.</b>

20:28.010 --> 20:30.480
<b>We'll settle our debt later.</b>

20:43.360 --> 20:46.490
<b>Now, where to next?</b>

20:46.490 --> 20:48.950
<b>The Purebloods in Europe?</b>

20:56.880 --> 20:59.840
<b>As long as there are
vampires in the world...</b>

21:01.050 --> 21:04.590
<b>And as long as there are people who
need protection from them...</b>

21:06.510 --> 21:09.220
<b>I will fight them.</b>

23:03.250 --> 23:05.430
<b>My name is Eric Brooks.</b>

23:06.380 --> 23:07.610
<b>I'm...</b>

23:07.940 --> 23:09.590
<b>a vampire hunter.</b>

23:10.640 --> 23:11.220
<b>Yeah...</b>

23:11.930 --> 23:14.260
<b>they're what goes bump in the night.</b>

23:17.230 --> 23:17.830
<b>Go.</b>

23:18.980 --> 23:21.770
<b>I hunted them down and cut them apart,
and it wasn't long</b>

23:21.770 --> 23:23.610
<b>before they started to call me this:</b>

23:27.630 --> 23:29.110
<b>Blade.</b>
